+    ) -> BinaryIO:
+        """Attach a reader to an already-open binary file, advancing a task as bytes are read.
+
+        The reader does not close the file. The progress display is not started by this method.
+
+        Args:
+            file (BinaryIO): An open binary file-like object to read from.
+            total (int, optional): Total size of the file in bytes. Defaults to the task total.
+            task_id (TaskID, optional): An existing task to advance. Defaults to a new task.
+            description (str, optional): Description of a new task. Defaults to "Reading...".
